#booksky #gantasyfaction

@madeleineswann.bsky.social 

Firstly: This. Was. So. Much. FUN! In a surreal, twisted kind of way. If Noel Coward sat down to write a screenplay of Aldous Huxley’s Brave New World, with cinematography by Luis Buñel, directed by Terry Gilliam channeling the spirit of 1/2>
